{"ID":"20251110203028-glhds1p","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251110203028-glhds1p","title":"UPL9-7——优化粒子系统","type":"doc","updated":"20251111115116"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203028-i8fc1wz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251110203028-i8fc1wz","updated":"20251110203202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粒子系统为什么会带来性能消耗"}]},{"ID":"20251110203108-okg0x3a","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203108-okg0x3a","updated":"20251110203155"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203108-jrerqtw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203108-jrerqtw","updated":"20251110203108"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203101-89j9fz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203101-89j9fz6","updated":"20251110203111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 消耗："}]},{"ID":"20251110203112-opn0ep9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203112-opn0ep9","updated":"20251110203139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粒子系统中，大多数模块都是 CPU 驱动模拟的，每帧会做很多工作，比如：\n粒子的生命周期管理、位置、速度、加速度、物理碰撞、回调函数调用、排序、包围盒更新、剔除、脚本交互 等等内容\n这些内容需要 CPU 每帧计算，那么它自然会带来 CPU 消耗\n若不同粒子之间的材质和网格不同，还会打断批处理，产生额外 DrawCall\n如果不使用批处理方案，在 DrawCall 上也存在更多开销"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203108-imz1bmu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203108-imz1bmu","updated":"20251110203155"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203101-gv27xkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203101-gv27xkj","updated":"20251110203101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU消耗："}]},{"ID":"20251110203141-n47ga3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203141-n47ga3v","updated":"20251110203155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粒子能被看到肯定需要渲染，那么当粒子被提交到 GPU 渲染时：\n顶点阶段的计算、片元阶段的计算、纹理采样、透明混合、阴影、光照影响都会给 GPU 带来消耗\n尤其是半透明粒子容易造成 OverDraw，会显著增加 GPU 负担"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203101-mvkc92i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203101-mvkc92i","updated":"20251110203158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由于粒子系统的表现特殊性，往往需要依赖 大量粒子叠加 来表现复杂效果\n如果不加控制，粒子数量增长会在 CPU、GPU 两方面同时放大开销\n因此需要特别关注粒子系统的性能影响与优化"}]},{"ID":"20251110203202-tdlxrm9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251110203202-tdlxrm9","updated":"20251111114035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粒子系统主要优化思路"}]},{"ID":"20251110203312-6lx3fa5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251110203312-6lx3fa5","updated":"20251111114035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 侧优化思路"}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-ba8tubo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-ba8tubo","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 侧：优化目标 —— 少算粒子"}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-cuzn8lf","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-cuzn8lf","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-xo20bu9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-xo20bu9","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-ewn8yjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-ewn8yjy","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低每帧要处理的粒子数"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-jjurpre","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-jjurpre","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-oxnhx9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-oxnhx9d","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低每个粒子要计算的内容"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-gfwrvmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-gfwrvmn","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要优化点："}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-heomlvd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-heomlvd","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-4bl3kob","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-4bl3kob","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-79v3pd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-79v3pd0","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少并发量"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-u8mfa3l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-u8mfa3l","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-gljlalg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-gljlalg","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少工作模块"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-loknkew","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-loknkew","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-ssfonp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-ssfonp9","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少排序开销"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-x90r5al","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-x90r5al","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-4c3zwnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-4c3zwnj","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少脚本调用"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-1pgjt3z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-1pgjt3z","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-yf4nx5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-yf4nx5t","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用剔除"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-a692nq4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-a692nq4","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-lmku0pp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-lmku0pp","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用对象池"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-nr2stn6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-nr2stn6","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203333-b2ngbvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-b2ngbvk","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"控制 DrawCall"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203333-g1gyj2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203333-g1gyj2m","updated":"20251110203333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251110203340-k4mrzua","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20251110203340-k4mrzua","updated":"20251111114035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少粒子数量的并发"}]},{"ID":"20251110203351-r6q9yhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203351-r6q9yhp","updated":"20251110203420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 每帧都要模拟所有存活粒子的状态，比如 位置、速度、旋转、颜色、生命周期 等等\n我们可以通过修改粒子系统上的一些参数来减少粒子数量的并发量"}]},{"ID":"20251110203404-1eimle7","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203404-1eimle7","updated":"20251111114035"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203404-dio5r5c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203404-dio5r5c","updated":"20251110203404"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203404-ff7i4rk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203404-ff7i4rk","updated":"20251110203404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缩短 开始生命时间（Start Lifetime）"}]},{"ID":"20251110203405-0o73wpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203405-0o73wpk","updated":"20251110203405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以降低并发粒子数量"}]},{"ID":"20251111113839-inhfkcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251111113839-inhfkcz","updated":"20251111113923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251111113923-r3ngxj5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203404-zfqx5ks","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203404-zfqx5ks","updated":"20251110203414"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203404-t87f5nb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203404-t87f5nb","updated":"20251110203414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"控制 发射频率（Emission 中的 Rate over Time）"}]},{"ID":"20251110203406-t1r7cd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203406-t1r7cd2","updated":"20251110203406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以避免过高的发射率，导致单位时间内粒子数过多"}]},{"ID":"20251111113954-r6bpuiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251111113954-r6bpuiu","updated":"20251111113956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251111113954-pr4q4yd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203404-u7vtchs","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203404-u7vtchs","updated":"20251111114035"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203404-yqo3xyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203404-yqo3xyy","updated":"20251110203404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"限制 最大粒子数 （Max Particles）"}]},{"ID":"20251110203408-3f47fh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203408-3f47fh9","updated":"20251110203408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"防止粒子峰值无限增长"}]},{"ID":"20251111114034-oxocz9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251111114034-oxocz9l","updated":"20251111114035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251111114035-kgvem1k.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203404-wbg1dhf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203404-wbg1dhf","updated":"20251110203404"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203404-epkv70s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203404-epkv70s","updated":"20251110203404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 LOD 或 距离剔除"}]},{"ID":"20251110203409-aep9jcp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203409-aep9jcp","updated":"20251110203409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"远处降低发射率甚至关闭"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203353-p2c2bwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203353-p2c2bwk","updated":"20251110203353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251110203422-27vbhvi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20251110203422-27vbhvi","updated":"20251111114511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少高开销模块的使用"}]},{"ID":"20251110203433-v1xqrcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203433-v1xqrcw","updated":"20251110203458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粒子系统中有各种各样的模块，增加模块的使用会增加计算量从而增加开销，因此对于以下高开销模块，应该谨慎使用："}]},{"ID":"20251110203458-pghtg0m","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-pghtg0m","updated":"20251111114511"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203458-us163uu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-us163uu","updated":"20251110203458"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203458-8qu74jo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-8qu74jo","updated":"20251110203458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"碰撞模块（Collision）"}]},{"ID":"20251110203500-mokcrpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203500-mokcrpu","updated":"20251110203505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粒子碰撞检测通常在 CPU 上进行，代价极高，我们应该能不用就不用\n如果一定要使用，尽量用简单的碰撞器进行检测，并且结合碰撞层矩阵进行优化\n关闭其中的 发送碰撞信息（Send Collision Messages）勾选项"}]},{"ID":"20251111114055-7jtr9o5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251111114055-7jtr9o5","updated":"20251111114202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251111114202-yd6791x.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203458-kuv16sm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-kuv16sm","updated":"20251110203458"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203458-yf62i7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-yf62i7h","updated":"20251110203458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"触发器模块（Triggers）"}]},{"ID":"20251110203511-9a3xkae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203511-9a3xkae","updated":"20251110203511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"触发需要逐粒子检测，频繁的调用回调函数\n如果一定要使用，要严格限制触发条件，仅在需要时启用"}]},{"ID":"20251111114217-ddb595k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251111114217-ddb595k","updated":"20251111114257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251111114257-8qr7cik.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203458-3mcn9b9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-3mcn9b9","updated":"20251110203458"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203458-2ke84qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-2ke84qz","updated":"20251110203458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"噪声扰动模块（Noise）"}]},{"ID":"20251110203513-yqs2i03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203513-yqs2i03","updated":"20251110203513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每帧采样噪声函数开销大\n如果一定要用，应该降低频率，减少强度\n或者用随机值一次性赋值，避免每帧采样"}]},{"ID":"20251111114304-5hkdbfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251111114304-5hkdbfa","updated":"20251111114334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251111114334-ngsam8t.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203458-26yzh5c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-26yzh5c","updated":"20251110203458"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203458-0gf18qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-0gf18qm","updated":"20251110203458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拖尾模块（Trails）"}]},{"ID":"20251110203515-my3rh4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203515-my3rh4f","updated":"20251111114350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拖尾效果会产生额外顶点，顶点数会呈指数级上升\n如果一定要使用，可以调大其中的 最小顶点距离（Minimum Vertex Distance）\n通过生命时间限制 最大轨迹长度"}]},{"ID":"20251111114346-di3id03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251111114346-di3id03","updated":"20251111114417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251111114417-ito5e6y.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203458-hf0zcdu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-hf0zcdu","updated":"20251111114511"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203458-p55dhzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203458-p55dhzr","updated":"20251110203458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子发射器模块（Sub Emitters）"}]},{"ID":"20251110203518-fsl6b4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203518-fsl6b4o","updated":"20251111114511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果利用子发射器在爆炸里再爆炸会产生指数级的粒子数，\n我们应该尽量不使用它，或只在关键效果触发，减少层级"}]},{"ID":"20251111114507-gcdzh7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251111114507-gcdzh7w","updated":"20251111114508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251111114508-qxyt9vl.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251110203433-79dc1ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110203433-79dc1ff","updated":"20251110203433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251110203520-wjiyadx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20251110203520-wjiyadx","updated":"20251111114903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少脚本和排序开销"}]},{"ID":"20251110203547-wge0o4i","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203547-wge0o4i","updated":"20251111114903"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110203547-slzxv37","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251110203547-slzxv37","updated":"20251111114903"},"Childr